WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.020 --> 00:00:05.140
Once upon a time, three little pigs
decided to build one house each.

2
00:00:05.760 --> 00:00:10.680
The first is a house with grass, the second
with wood and the third with bricks.

3
00:00:11.280 --> 00:00:17.260
One day, a big wolf came, and she blew
the first house and the second house.

4
00:00:17.880 --> 00:00:24.080
Two little pigs ran into the red house, the big gray
wolf blew it up and then the red house was strong.

5
00:00:24.800 --> 00:00:29.480
Three beads are safe, they understand
that working hard brings security.
